"Rekiss-tha is an Artonan Contract Artist, a tattooist, at the Palace of Unbreaking on Artona III."
"She works at the House of the Southern Convocation and inked every Velra's first family tattoo."
"She has reddish-brown eyes, a hovering translation lens and rainbow-colored wizard garb."
"She says contracts are sacred, and when one is unbalanced the stronger party wins."
